<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Dear&nbsp;{{{Recipient.FirstName}}},&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Your order is ready to ship. To proceed, please advise the shipping method and carrier preference. You may choose from the following options:
<ul>
	<li><strong>Collect</strong></li>
	<li><strong>Prepaid Third Party</strong>&nbsp;(please include billing address)</li>
	<li><strong>PPI Selects</strong>&nbsp;(Prepaid and Add to Invoice)</li>
	<li><strong>Submit a BOL</strong>&nbsp;(if preferred)</li>
</ul>
<strong>Weights &amp; Dimensions</strong>: [insert details]<br />
<br />
<strong>Ship from Location</strong>: [insert location here]<br />
<br />
Please let us know your preference at your earliest convenience so we can arrange shipment promptly.<br />
<br />
Thank you,<br />
{{{Sender.Signature}}}</body>
</html>